   "kind": "law",
   "claim": "No cell is in both the `y` and the `u` set",
   "evidence": "probe:83-85 builds Group((; f = Follower()); local_wires = (\"f/on\" => \"f/go\",)), a stage-1 port wired back to its own input. The build succeeds, so cell f/on is in f's own `y` and in f's `u`.",
